      "text": "This is so inaccurate. The videos are not Tristan Da Cuna. I met the islanders when they were evacuated to Merstham Surrey UK because the volcano erupted. Most of them returned, a few stayed having developed relationships with members of our community. There were no cars on the island and they had one boat belonging to the whole community. If you are going to make videos like this at least get your facts accurate.",
